Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.69,0:00:03.89,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}（星光）我要消灭巴利安世界。
Dialogue: 0,0:00:04.85,0:00:05.97,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}（游马）那种事……
Dialogue: 0,0:00:05.97,0:00:07.45,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}那种事我绝对不会让你得逞。
Dialogue: 0,0:00:07.83,0:00:08.81,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}那么，你打算怎么办？
Dialogue: 0,0:00:09.26,0:00:12.19,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}既然这样……既然这样，那就决斗吧。
Dialogue: 0,0:00:12.63,0:00:15.17,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}也好。那么，如果我赢了{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:00:15.58,0:00:17.48,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}就消灭巴利安世界{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:00:18.21,0:00:23.01,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}然后，关于我的你的记忆也全部消除。
Dialogue: 0,0:00:24.62,0:00:25.71,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}怎么了，游马。
Dialogue: 0,0:00:26.29,0:00:28.37,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}已经失去战斗的意志了吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:00:29.15,0:00:31.33,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}果然向我挑战决斗这种事{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:00:32.49,0:00:33.90,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}你还早了100年。
Dialogue: 0,0:00:36.10,0:00:40.38,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我发动魔法卡「艾克西斯宝藏」。
Dialogue: 0,0:00:40.93,0:00:43.33,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}场上每有1只怪兽
Dialogue: 0,0:00:43.33,0:00:44.88,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}就抽1张卡。
Dialogue: 0,0:00:45.64,0:00:49.25,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}因此我抽5张卡。
Dialogue: 0,0:00:51.70,0:00:56.14,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我盖放3张卡，回合结束。
Dialogue: 0,0:00:57.46,0:00:59.09,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}({\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}Ⅲ{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe})场上有5只霍普。
Dialogue: 0,0:00:59.54,0:01:02.21,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}对手是使用全 No.卡组的星光体
Dialogue: 0,0:01:02.21,0:01:02.91,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}游马他…。
Dialogue: 0,0:01:03.39,0:01:05.37,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}({\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}Ⅳ{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe})啊啊 什么卡组手牌
Dialogue: 0,0:01:05.37,0:01:06.73,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}完全不顾 全力全开。
Dialogue: 0,0:01:07.40,0:01:08.85,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}({\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}Ⅴ{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe})星光体的认真
Dialogue: 0,0:01:08.85,0:01:11.47,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}果然这场决斗中 No.卡是关键。
Dialogue: 0,0:01:15.08,0:01:16.36,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}(多洛瓦)就算是那家伙也…。
Dialogue: 0,0:01:16.99,0:01:18.63,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}(戈什)这么压倒性的力量
Dialogue: 0,0:01:18.63,0:01:19.69,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}被展示在眼前啊。
Dialogue: 0,0:01:20.21,0:01:23.11,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}(等{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}々{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}力)到头来这么一边倒的决斗。
Dialogue: 0,0:01:23.80,0:01:25.32,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}(安娜)真是太过分了。
Dialogue: 0,0:01:25.58,0:01:27.55,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}(铁男)难得游马和星光体
Dialogue: 0,0:01:27.55,0:01:29.39,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}最初也是最后的决斗。
Dialogue: 0,0:01:29.85,0:01:31.44,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}(凯西)已经看不下去了。
Dialogue: 0,0:01:33.81,0:01:36.56,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}((星光体会怎么使用 No.卡
Dialogue: 0,0:01:36.56,0:01:38.05,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}就看这个了))
Dialogue: 0,0:01:39.38,0:01:39.90,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}(小鸟)游马…。
Dialogue: 0,0:01:41.70,0:01:43.83,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}来吧 轮到你了。
Dialogue: 0,0:01:44.33,0:01:46.74,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}还是说 真的已经心灰意冷了？
Dialogue: 0,0:01:53.82,0:01:57.21,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}嘿嘿嘿 简直帅爆了 霍普！
Dialogue: 0,0:01:58.31,0:01:58.93,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}游马？
Dialogue: 0,0:02:00.50,0:02:03.17,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}平时都只能看到霍普的背影根本看不到正面啊。
Dialogue: 0,0:02:04.55,0:02:06.75,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}而这次居然能在
Dialogue: 0,0:02:06.75,0:02:09.61,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这么个特等席上看到5只霍普并排。
Dialogue: 0,0:02:10.31,0:02:12.75,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}真是的比想象中还要帅啊。
Dialogue: 0,0:02:13.74,0:02:16.18,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}唯一让我不甘心的是{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:02:17.38,0:02:19.29,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我没办法用那家伙。
Dialogue: 0,0:02:20.62,0:02:22.37,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}以你的性格不用我说你也知道{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:02:23.58,0:02:25.72,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}一定要好好驾驭它啊 星光体！
Dialogue: 0,0:02:26.39,0:02:28.15,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}来吧 接下来才是真正的胜负。
Dialogue: 0,0:02:29.00,0:02:30.29,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}可别放水啊！
Dialogue: 0,0:02:31.09,0:02:33.58,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}哦 挺有骨气的嘛。
Dialogue: 0,0:02:34.19,0:02:37.10,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}游马 他还没有放弃。
Dialogue: 0,0:02:37.68,0:02:39.28,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这正是他的本色。嗯。
Dialogue: 0,0:02:40.47,0:02:41.39,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}真是的……
Dialogue: 0,0:02:41.98,0:02:43.16,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}还是老样子啊。
Dialogue: 0,0:02:43.58,0:02:46.35,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}但是你真的打算跟5只霍普战斗吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:02:46.77,0:02:47.49,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}(罗宾)太乱来了。
Dialogue: 0,0:02:48.30,0:02:49.96,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}No.卡不靠 No.卡
Dialogue: 0,0:02:49.96,0:02:50.79,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}是破坏不了的。
Dialogue: 0,0:02:51.22,0:02:52.08,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}要怎么做？
Dialogue: 0,0:02:55.03,0:02:56.36,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}是啊 游马。
Dialogue: 0,0:02:57.21,0:03:00.93,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}加油！把游马的全部都砸向星光体吧！
Dialogue: 0,0:03:01.14,0:03:02.93,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}哦！我来干。
Dialogue: 0,0:03:03.45,0:03:05.85,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}上了 我的回合 抽卡！
Dialogue: 0,0:03:06.32,0:03:08.80,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}《没错游马 再认真点放马过来。
Dialogue: 0,0:03:09.55,0:03:12.01,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}不然的话 你失去的东西{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:03:13.01,0:03:13.81,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}就夺不回来！》
Dialogue: 0,0:04:46.56,0:04:49.77,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我发动魔法卡 超量宝藏！
Dialogue: 0,0:04:50.62,0:04:52.66,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}每有1只怪兽超量
Dialogue: 0,0:04:52.66,0:04:54.27,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}就抽1张卡。
Dialogue: 0,0:04:55.11,0:04:58.12,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}因此 我抽5张卡！
Dialogue: 0,0:04:58.81,0:05:01.18,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我召唤 我我我魔术师。
Dialogue: 0,0:05:03.66,0:05:05.61,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这只怪兽1回合1次{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:05:05.61,0:05:07.94,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}可以将墓地里的 我我我怪兽
Dialogue: 0,0:05:07.94,0:05:08.92,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}特殊召唤！
Dialogue: 0,0:05:12.91,0:05:15.13,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}现身吧！ 我我我少女！
Dialogue: 0,0:05:17.01,0:05:19.63,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}4星怪兽有2只… 要来了吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:05:20.36,0:05:21.40,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}别那么慌！
Dialogue: 0,0:05:21.40,0:05:24.44,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}发动永续陷阱 我我我镜！
Dialogue: 0,0:05:25.74,0:05:26.46,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这张卡可以
Dialogue: 0,0:05:26.46,0:05:28.49,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}将场上的1只我我我怪兽{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:05:29.31,0:05:31.34,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}当作2只超量素材！
Dialogue: 0,0:05:32.26,0:05:34.40,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}而且用这个效果超量召唤时{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:05:34.90,0:05:38.16,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}1回合1次可以无视属性和种族。
Dialogue: 0,0:05:39.27,0:05:40.42,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我用 变成2只份的
Dialogue: 0,0:05:40.42,0:05:42.60,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}4星我我我魔术师叠放！
Dialogue: 0,0:05:45.61,0:05:46.90,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}超量召唤！
Dialogue: 0,0:05:48.96,0:05:51.27,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}现身吧 我我我枪手！
Dialogue: 0,0:05:55.41,0:05:56.93,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}而且！ 变成2只份的
Dialogue: 0,0:05:56.93,0:06:00.12,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}用等级4的嘎嘎嘎魔导士超量召唤！
Dialogue: 0,0:06:01.22,0:06:02.46,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}超量召唤！
Dialogue: 0,0:06:05.14,0:06:07.88,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}出来吧 嘎嘎嘎侍！
Dialogue: 0,0:06:10.80,0:06:13.21,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我发动 嘎嘎嘎侍的效果！
Dialogue: 0,0:06:14.04,0:06:14.94,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}1回合1次
Dialogue: 0,0:06:14.94,0:06:16.97,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}使用1个超量单位{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:06:18.52,0:06:19.87,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}让嘎嘎嘎怪兽
Dialogue: 0,0:06:19.87,0:06:21.38,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}可以攻击2次！
Dialogue: 0,0:06:23.30,0:06:25.68,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这样一来 我的2只嘎嘎嘎怪兽
Dialogue: 0,0:06:25.68,0:06:26.83,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}就能攻击2次了！
Dialogue: 0,0:06:27.77,0:06:30.30,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}再发动 嘎嘎嘎汉的效果！
Dialogue: 0,0:06:30.94,0:06:32.99,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}使用1个超量单位{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:06:32.99,0:06:33.52,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}攻击力
Dialogue: 0,0:06:33.52,0:06:35.41,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}提升1000点！
Dialogue: 0,0:06:36.37,0:06:37.99,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}并且在战斗时{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:06:37.99,0:06:39.71,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}对手怪兽的攻击力
Dialogue: 0,0:06:39.71,0:06:41.33,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}下降500点。
Dialogue: 0,0:06:42.05,0:06:44.43,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}但是 因为彼岸·希望的效果{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:06:44.70,0:06:46.38,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我场上的怪兽
Dialogue: 0,0:06:46.38,0:06:48.23,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}不会受到任何效果影响！
Dialogue: 0,0:06:49.33,0:06:50.79,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}区区嘎嘎嘎嘎曼是
Dialogue: 0,0:06:50.79,0:06:52.32,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}打不倒我的怪兽的！
Dialogue: 0,0:06:52.49,0:06:54.38,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}不，那可不一定！
Dialogue: 0,0:06:54.80,0:06:55.43,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}什么！？
Dialogue: 0,0:06:56.12,0:06:59.18,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我发动墓地中嘎嘎嘎曼萨的效果！
Dialogue: 0,0:06:59.68,0:07:01.22,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}通过将这张卡除外{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}→
Dialogue: 0,0:07:02.04,0:07:04.32,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}让1只嘎嘎嘎怪兽的攻击力
Dialogue: 0,0:07:04.32,0:07:06.07,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}提升500点！
Dialogue: 0,0:07:07.72,0:07:10.68,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}嘎嘎嘎嘎曼的攻击力又提升了！
Dialogue: 0,0:07:11.16,0:07:12.97,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}上吧！嘎嘎嘎嘎曼！
Dialogue: 0,0:07:13.46,0:07:15.20,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}攻击希望皇霍普雷！
Dialogue: 0,0:07:20.86,0:07:23.53,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}No.怪兽被 No.以外的怪兽
Dialogue: 0,0:07:23.53,0:07:24.25,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}破坏了！
Dialogue: 0,0:07:24.74,0:07:26.33,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}而且嘎嘎嘎嘎曼
Dialogue: 0,0:07:26.33,0:07:27.70,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}还能再攻击一次！
Dialogue: 0,0:07:28.40,0:07:30.09,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}攻击霍普雷V！
Dialogue: 0,0:07:37.34,0:07:39.35,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}游马竟然破坏了2只霍普！
Dialogue: 0,0:07:39.86,0:07:41.62,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}看来游马很冷静啊。
Dialogue: 0,0:07:42.68,0:07:44.94,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}上个回合通过速攻魔法{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}→
Dialogue: 0,0:07:45.12,0:07:46.11,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}特殊召唤出来的
Dialogue: 0,0:07:46.11,0:07:48.65,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}「希望皇 霍普」和「希望皇 霍普V」{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:07:48.65,0:07:50.20,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}失去了怪兽效果。
Dialogue: 0,0:07:51.83,0:07:53.67,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这样一来 就算是「No.」也能
Dialogue: 0,0:07:53.67,0:07:54.86,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}将其破坏掉了。
Dialogue: 0,0:07:55.57,0:07:56.97,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}破坏了「No.」
Dialogue: 0,0:07:56.97,0:07:59.61,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}还削减了我的生命值 这点值得称赞{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:07:59.97,0:08:02.54,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}但「我我我枪手」的攻击到此为止了！
Dialogue: 0,0:08:03.98,0:08:05.14,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}看来你已经无计可施了！
Dialogue: 0,0:08:05.58,0:08:08.73,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}不！ 无计可施的是你才对！
Dialogue: 0,0:08:09.15,0:08:09.81,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}什么！？
Dialogue: 0,0:08:10.88,0:08:14.41,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我发动速攻魔法「我我我流 明镜死斩」！
Dialogue: 0,0:08:15.85,0:08:17.54,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这张卡可以选择自己场上的
Dialogue: 0,0:08:17.54,0:08:19.12,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}1只「我我我」怪兽{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:08:19.74,0:08:22.07,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这个回合 获得与战斗对手怪兽
Dialogue: 0,0:08:22.07,0:08:23.44,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}相同的名字和攻击力{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:08:23.79,0:08:26.09,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}并且 不会被战斗破坏{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:08:26.45,0:08:27.83,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}将破坏的怪兽的
Dialogue: 0,0:08:27.83,0:08:30.42,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}攻击力数值的伤害给予对手！
Dialogue: 0,0:08:30.75,0:08:31.45,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}什么！？
Dialogue: 0,0:08:32.22,0:08:34.08,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我选择 嘎嘎嘎武士！
Dialogue: 0,0:08:35.14,0:08:36.92,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}攻击 彼岸·希望！
Dialogue: 0,0:08:37.49,0:08:39.44,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这个瞬间 嘎嘎嘎武士
Dialogue: 0,0:08:39.44,0:08:42.48,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}获得 彼岸·希望 的攻击力和名字。
Dialogue: 0,0:08:42.91,0:08:44.52,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这样就能破坏 No. 了！
Dialogue: 0,0:08:45.45,0:08:47.79,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}希望剑 彼岸·斩击！
Dialogue: 0,0:08:51.72,0:08:53.30,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}然后 明镜死斩{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:08:53.30,0:08:56.47,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}将破坏的怪兽的攻击力份的伤害
Dialogue: 0,0:08:56.47,0:08:57.53,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}给予对手！
Dialogue: 0,0:09:01.43,0:09:02.10,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}还没完！
Dialogue: 0,0:09:03.06,0:09:06.06,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}还没嘎嘎嘎武士的攻击还有剩余！
Dialogue: 0,0:09:06.49,0:09:07.84,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}嘎嘎嘎武士
Dialogue: 0,0:09:07.84,0:09:10.13,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}攻击 希望·胜利！
Dialogue: 0,0:09:12.00,0:09:13.65,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}如果这次攻击通过的话！
Dialogue: 0,0:09:14.03,0:09:15.93,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}(德之助)受到胜利的攻击力份的
Dialogue: 0,0:09:15.93,0:09:16.80,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}伤害…。
Dialogue: 0,0:09:17.58,0:09:18.73,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}阿斯特拉尔败北！
Dialogue: 0,0:09:21.06,0:09:24.57,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我发动 速攻魔法发动 灼热与治愈！
Dialogue: 0,0:09:25.69,0:09:26.02,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这张卡的效果是，将场上
Dialogue: 0,0:09:26.02,0:09:26.49,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}等级最低的「No.」怪兽的攻击力数值{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:09:26.84,0:09:32.47,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}用来回复我的生命值！
Dialogue: 0,0:09:34.32,0:09:37.40,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}希望剑 双重胜利斩！
Dialogue: 0,0:09:42.28,0:09:45.71,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}然后 承受那攻击力数值的伤害吧！
Dialogue: 0,0:09:52.90,0:09:53.58,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}星光！
Dialogue: 0,0:09:54.89,0:09:56.93,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}并且 灼热与治愈会成为使用了效果的「希望」的{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:09:57.38,0:10:00.18,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}叠放单位！
Dialogue: 0,0:10:02.19,0:10:04.28,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}喂 你 没事吧！？
Dialogue: 0,0:10:05.93,0:10:07.99,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我居然会这么大意。
Dialogue: 0,0:10:08.92,0:10:10.81,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}在你看到5只「希望」的时候
Dialogue: 0,0:10:10.81,0:10:11.98,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我就该察觉到的。
Dialogue: 0,0:10:13.30,0:10:15.78,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}((真是超乎想象的帅气啊！))
Dialogue: 0,0:10:17.52,0:10:20.19,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}超乎想象 也就是说 你{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:10:20.50,0:10:23.16,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}早就预想到了5只「希望」会排列在一起。
Dialogue: 0,0:10:23.70,0:10:25.28,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}嘿嘿嘿……被发现了吗！
Dialogue: 0,0:10:26.21,0:10:29.01,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}竟然还演了一出被呼啦圈登场吓到的戏。
Dialogue: 0,0:10:30.52,0:10:31.98,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}做这副卡组的时间
Dialogue: 0,0:10:31.98,0:10:34.14,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}是我人生中动脑最多的一次！
Dialogue: 0,0:10:34.90,0:10:37.33,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}而在这期间我一直都在回想。
Dialogue: 0,0:10:38.95,0:10:40.57,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}回想和你一起战斗过来的事。
Dialogue: 0,0:10:41.61,0:10:43.65,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}让我变得这么强的
Dialogue: 0,0:10:43.65,0:10:45.43,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}是阿斯特拉尔，是你。
Dialogue: 0,0:10:47.19,0:10:48.88,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}和你一起跨越过来的
Dialogue: 0,0:10:48.88,0:10:50.87,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}那些困难，给了我自信。
Dialogue: 0,0:10:51.53,0:10:54.82,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}给了我坚信的力量，给了我相信他人的力量！
Dialogue: 0,0:10:55.65,0:10:57.34,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我和你是同心一体。
Dialogue: 0,0:10:58.33,0:11:01.56,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}所以，如果我拥有相信他人的力量的话{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:11:02.05,0:11:03.31,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}那一定，你也同样拥有。
Dialogue: 0,0:11:04.34,0:11:07.73,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}所以我要再一次把相信他人的力量{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:11:08.29,0:11:09.92,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我希望你相信，无论是谁
Dialogue: 0,0:11:09.92,0:11:11.56,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}都拥有开拓未来的力量！
Dialogue: 0,0:11:13.00,0:11:14.33,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}所以我不会放弃！
Dialogue: 0,0:11:15.42,0:11:17.31,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}就算你是世界最强的决斗者{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:11:18.48,0:11:19.86,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}哪怕这是一万次里
Dialogue: 0,0:11:19.86,0:11:21.68,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}只能赢一次的决斗{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:11:22.62,0:11:26.15,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}在这场决斗中我也要引发那个奇迹！
Dialogue: 0,0:11:28.43,0:11:33.42,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}哼，这才像话。放马过来吧，游马！
Dialogue: 0,0:11:34.18,0:11:37.66,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我作为星光界的代表会全力战斗！
Dialogue: 0,0:11:38.86,0:11:41.03,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}让我看看你的全力！
Dialogue: 0,0:11:41.87,0:11:44.87,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}怎么感觉两个人的意见好像对不上啊。
Dialogue: 0,0:11:45.46,0:11:46.84,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}嗯，这是……
Dialogue: 0,0:11:47.17,0:11:47.89,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}果然没错。
Dialogue: 0,0:11:48.95,0:11:49.58,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}大哥。
Dialogue: 0,0:11:50.32,0:11:51.47,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}星光的使命。
Dialogue: 0,0:11:52.10,0:11:54.22,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}那就是使用 No.代码
Dialogue: 0,0:11:54.22,0:11:56.26,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}消灭巴利安世界。
Dialogue: 0,0:11:57.31,0:11:59.34,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}那份决心从未改变。
Dialogue: 0,0:11:59.80,0:12:02.92,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}怎么会……这种事情游马绝对不会允许！
Dialogue: 0,0:12:03.61,0:12:04.86,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}正因为如此，游马才
Dialogue: 0,0:12:04.86,0:12:06.26,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}想要让阿斯托拉尔{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:12:06.26,0:12:07.44,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}打消那个决定
Dialogue: 0,0:12:07.44,0:12:08.76,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}才会这么做的吧。
Dialogue: 0,0:12:09.66,0:12:12.40,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}可是为什么阿斯托拉尔要做那种事……
Dialogue: 0,0:12:13.11,0:12:15.77,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}明明关于游马的事，他应该是最了解的。
Dialogue: 0,0:12:16.75,0:12:20.57,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}对了，是这场决斗还是别的什么原因……
Dialogue: 0,0:12:20.96,0:12:22.12,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}好嘞！我
Dialogue: 0,0:12:22.12,0:12:24.93,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}盖三张卡，回合结束！
Dialogue: 0,0:12:25.68,0:12:27.57,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}然后，我我我枪手的
Dialogue: 0,0:12:27.57,0:12:29.00,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}攻击力恢复原样！
Dialogue: 0,0:12:30.36,0:12:32.67,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我的回合，抽卡！
Dialogue: 0,0:12:33.79,0:12:35.78,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}来吧，阿斯托拉尔！
Dialogue: 0,0:12:36.38,0:12:40.22,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我用希望皇霍普攻击我我我枪手！
Dialogue: 0,0:12:44.81,0:12:47.34,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}陷阱发动！半·不破！
Dialogue: 0,0:12:48.26,0:12:51.43,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这张卡可以保护怪兽不被破坏
Dialogue: 0,0:12:51.43,0:12:54.02,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}并将发生的伤害减半！
Dialogue: 0,0:12:54.38,0:12:56.63,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}那我也发动陷阱！
Dialogue: 0,0:12:56.63,0:12:58.77,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}绝对·屏障！
Dialogue: 0,0:12:59.18,0:13:02.04,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这张卡可以保护怪兽不被破坏
Dialogue: 0,0:13:02.04,0:13:03.60,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}只无效其效果！
Dialogue: 0,0:13:04.85,0:13:06.33,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}唔 被看穿了吗！
Dialogue: 0,0:13:06.86,0:13:08.26,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}霍普剑斩！
Dialogue: 0,0:13:19.61,0:13:20.35,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}游马！
Dialogue: 0,0:13:21.34,0:13:24.60,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}游马 就像你对我了如指掌一样{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:13:25.12,0:13:26.93,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我也对你了如指掌。
Dialogue: 0,0:13:27.52,0:13:30.12,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}所以 这场决斗 我不会手下留情。
Dialogue: 0,0:13:31.21,0:13:35.46,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我盖放３张卡 回合结束！
Dialogue: 0,0:13:37.14,0:13:38.45,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}来吧 游马！
Dialogue: 0,0:13:41.07,0:13:43.65,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}《星光 还有霍普。
Dialogue: 0,0:13:44.80,0:13:46.29,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}当我与星光相遇时{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:13:46.96,0:13:48.73,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}第一次得到的 怪兽超量。
Dialogue: 0,0:13:49.66,0:13:52.35,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}No.39 希望皇霍普。
Dialogue: 0,0:13:54.13,0:13:56.88,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}第一次超量召唤那份激动我永远不会忘。
Dialogue: 0,0:13:58.26,0:13:59.98,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}和你一路战斗至今
Dialogue: 0,0:14:00.70,0:14:03.51,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}霍普 你就是我的希望。
Dialogue: 0,0:14:05.38,0:14:08.53,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}但是如今 我必须超越你才行
Dialogue: 0,0:14:09.65,0:14:10.66,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}霍普！》
Dialogue: 0,0:14:11.83,0:14:13.85,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}燃起来了 我！
Dialogue: 0,0:14:14.41,0:14:16.42,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我的回合 抽卡！
Dialogue: 0,0:14:17.52,0:14:21.69,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}《没错 不要放弃无论多少次都放马过来吧！》
Dialogue: 0,0:14:24.83,0:14:27.86,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我发动装备魔法 我我我复仇！
Dialogue: 0,0:14:28.60,0:14:29.23,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}将这张卡
Dialogue: 0,0:14:29.23,0:14:31.22,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}装备到墓地里的我我我怪兽上{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:14:31.90,0:14:33.91,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}以攻击表示特殊召唤！
Dialogue: 0,0:14:34.97,0:14:37.34,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}复活吧 我我我枪手！
Dialogue: 0,0:14:41.55,0:14:43.08,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}来吧 上吧 星光体！
Dialogue: 0,0:14:43.68,0:14:45.02,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这就是我的全力！
Dialogue: 0,0:14:45.71,0:14:49.26,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我用 我我我枪手 攻击霍普！
Dialogue: 0,0:14:49.80,0:14:50.57,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}什么！？
Dialogue: 0,0:14:54.81,0:14:57.13,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}怎么会…用比霍普攻击力还低的{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:14:57.13,0:14:59.30,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我我我我我我枪手来攻击！
Dialogue: 0,0:14:59.90,0:15:01.94,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}而且现在的我我我我我我枪手
Dialogue: 0,0:15:01.94,0:15:03.40,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}没有超量单元。
Dialogue: 0,0:15:06.22,0:15:09.95,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}1000{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}｡\N{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}《我我我我我我枪手和霍普的攻击力差是{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡\N{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}1000。
Dialogue: 0,0:15:10.80,0:15:12.18,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}游马的生命值是900。
Dialogue: 0,0:15:13.21,0:15:15.79,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}就这样攻击霍普的话游马就…》
Dialogue: 0,0:15:20.51,0:15:23.52,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}《这个攻击 有什么玄机》
Dialogue: 0,0:15:24.59,0:15:27.14,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我发动霍普的效果！
Dialogue: 0,0:15:27.73,0:15:30.43,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}使用1个超量单元
Dialogue: 0,0:15:30.43,0:15:33.45,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}让1只怪兽的攻击无效！
Dialogue: 0,0:15:34.81,0:15:35.94,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}月之屏障！
Dialogue: 0,0:15:42.29,0:15:44.56,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这样我我我我我我枪手的攻击就无效了。
Dialogue: 0,0:15:45.93,0:15:47.97,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}上钩了 星光体！
Dialogue: 0,0:15:48.70,0:15:49.38,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}什么！？
Dialogue: 0,0:15:49.89,0:15:52.98,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}陷阱发动 月之护罩！
Dialogue: 0,0:15:53.87,0:15:55.93,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}当怪兽的攻击被无效时{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:15:56.71,0:15:58.90,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}将对方怪兽的效果无效化{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:15:59.33,0:16:01.62,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}攻击力下降800点！
Dialogue: 0,0:16:02.45,0:16:04.88,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}你读到了我会无效攻击这件事…。
Dialogue: 0,0:16:05.57,0:16:06.98,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}那么 刚才的攻击是…。
Dialogue: 0,0:16:07.41,0:16:09.05,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}啊啊 虽然有点被吓到了
Dialogue: 0,0:16:09.05,0:16:11.01,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}但我就知道 是你的话会这么做。
Dialogue: 0,0:16:11.66,0:16:13.31,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}上吧 我我我侍！
Dialogue: 0,0:16:13.76,0:16:15.94,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}攻击希望皇霍普！
Dialogue: 0,0:16:27.22,0:16:28.67,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}好耶～！
Dialogue: 0,0:16:30.23,0:16:32.29,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}干得漂亮 游马。
Dialogue: 0,0:16:33.01,0:16:35.66,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}居然连决斗的胜负都拿来虚张声势。
Dialogue: 0,0:16:36.55,0:16:37.59,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}但这才正是{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:16:40.61,0:16:42.48,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}只有你才能做到的决斗啊。
Dialogue: 0,0:16:43.33,0:16:45.36,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}居然打倒了5只霍普！
Dialogue: 0,0:16:45.59,0:16:46.96,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}游马 太棒了！
Dialogue: 0,0:16:47.31,0:16:48.39,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}那家伙！
Dialogue: 0,0:16:48.80,0:16:50.00,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}居然对星光体…。
Dialogue: 0,0:16:50.41,0:16:52.13,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}真是的 让人捏一把汗。
Dialogue: 0,0:16:52.48,0:16:54.37,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}不过 很有游马的风格。
Dialogue: 0,0:16:55.30,0:16:58.40,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}果然 和你的决斗比想象中还要燃啊！
Dialogue: 0,0:16:59.21,0:17:01.75,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}如果 这场决斗中没有发生那种事的话…。
Dialogue: 0,0:17:03.04,0:17:06.28,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}((我要 让巴利安世界消灭))
Dialogue: 0,0:17:07.88,0:17:11.39,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}喂 星光体你 已经忘了吗。
Dialogue: 0,0:17:12.29,0:17:13.75,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}埃利法斯和我的决斗。
Dialogue: 0,0:17:14.48,0:17:15.16,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}在那场决斗中
Dialogue: 0,0:17:15.94,0:17:17.73,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}世界可不只是升级而已。
Dialogue: 0,0:17:18.38,0:17:20.27,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}把看不顺眼的家伙统统舍弃掉{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:17:20.69,0:17:22.92,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}那种事可不是我们追求的未来。
Dialogue: 0,0:17:23.51,0:17:25.20,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}不只是升级才是未来
Dialogue: 0,0:17:25.20,0:17:26.96,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}你应该已经找到了这个答案！
Dialogue: 0,0:17:27.55,0:17:29.49,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}所以埃利法斯才把未来
Dialogue: 0,0:17:29.49,0:17:31.29,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}托付给了我们不是吗！
Dialogue: 0,0:17:33.68,0:17:35.00,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}不管什么事 都能重新来过。
Dialogue: 0,0:17:35.53,0:17:36.74,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}和任何人都 能互相理解。
Dialogue: 0,0:17:37.58,0:17:38.90,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}喂 星光体！
Dialogue: 0,0:17:39.58,0:17:40.39,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我不会忘记。
Dialogue: 0,0:17:42.86,0:17:44.26,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}怎么可能会忘得掉。
Dialogue: 0,0:17:45.41,0:17:48.29,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}你的话语 与你共度的时光。
Dialogue: 0,0:17:49.98,0:17:51.08,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}哪怕只是一瞬。
Dialogue: 0,0:17:53.41,0:17:54.03,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}星光体……
Dialogue: 0,0:17:55.13,0:17:56.76,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}你总有一天要
Dialogue: 0,0:17:56.76,0:17:58.94,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}履行与我许下的约定！
Dialogue: 0,0:18:00.64,0:18:01.27,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}约定？
Dialogue: 0,0:18:02.70,0:18:03.30,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}和你的……
Dialogue: 0,0:18:05.45,0:18:08.50,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}游马 答案永远都在决斗之中！
Dialogue: 0,0:18:09.01,0:18:10.93,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}上了 我发动速攻魔法
Dialogue: 0,0:18:10.93,0:18:14.22,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}降阶魔法 希望坠落！
Dialogue: 0,0:18:15.05,0:18:16.31,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}降阶魔法！？
Dialogue: 0,0:18:16.65,0:18:17.39,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这张卡
Dialogue: 0,0:18:17.39,0:18:19.91,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}在自己场上的 No.怪兽被破坏时{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:18:20.38,0:18:22.37,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}将比它阶级更低的怪兽超量召唤{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:18:22.95,0:18:26.20,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}以被破坏的 No.怪兽作为素材{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:18:26.20,0:18:27.77,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}超量召唤。
Dialogue: 0,0:18:28.65,0:18:31.00,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}阶级下降 超量变换！
Dialogue: 0,0:18:32.66,0:18:34.82,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}现身吧 阶级1。
Dialogue: 0,0:18:35.23,0:18:40.60,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}No.39 希望皇 霍普·根！
Dialogue: 0,0:18:44.95,0:18:46.23,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}霍普·根！？
Dialogue: 0,0:18:47.40,0:18:48.65,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}你居然进行阶级下降……
Dialogue: 0,0:18:51.87,0:18:55.29,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我盖放一张卡 回合结束。
Dialogue: 0,0:18:57.48,0:19:00.06,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}游马 夺回来吧。
Dialogue: 0,0:19:00.93,0:19:01.28,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}哎！？
Dialogue: 0,0:19:02.32,0:19:04.90,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我的回合 抽卡！
Dialogue: 0,0:19:05.55,0:19:08.59,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我发动装备魔法 No.框架。
Dialogue: 0,0:19:09.19,0:19:11.21,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}将这张卡装备到自己的霍普上{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}→
Dialogue: 0,0:19:11.67,0:19:13.01,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}使怪兽的攻击力
Dialogue: 0,0:19:13.01,0:19:15.05,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}上升1500点。
Dialogue: 0,0:19:15.92,0:19:18.88,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}再将额外卡组的2只 No.怪兽
Dialogue: 0,0:19:18.88,0:19:20.77,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}变为超量单元。
Dialogue: 0,0:19:21.64,0:19:25.56,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我将 No.32 鲨鱼龙和{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}→
Dialogue: 0,0:19:26.63,0:19:27.61,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}No.62
Dialogue: 0,0:19:27.61,0:19:30.53,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}银河眼·光子龙{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}→
Dialogue: 0,0:19:31.31,0:19:33.65,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}变为霍普·根的超量单元。
Dialogue: 0,0:19:35.73,0:19:37.20,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}把鲨鱼和快斗的卡
Dialogue: 0,0:19:37.20,0:19:38.60,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}变成超量单元！
Dialogue: 0,0:19:39.21,0:19:41.81,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}《游马 我绝不会忘记。
Dialogue: 0,0:19:42.64,0:19:45.60,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}与你一起 还有和鲨鱼、快斗
Dialogue: 0,0:19:45.60,0:19:47.92,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}与同伴们一同战斗过的事。
Dialogue: 0,0:19:48.95,0:19:51.86,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}但是 命运却给予了你残酷的苦难。
Dialogue: 0,0:19:52.58,0:19:55.43,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}你身心俱疲、遍体鳞伤
Dialogue: 0,0:19:55.43,0:19:57.23,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}却依然忍耐 跨越过来{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:19:57.55,0:19:59.35,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}为我们带来了胜利。
Dialogue: 0,0:20:00.23,0:20:03.37,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}然而 那却在你自身都未曾察觉之时{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:20:03.81,0:20:06.50,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}从你身上 将最重要的东西夺走了。
Dialogue: 0,0:20:07.59,0:20:08.59,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}所以 我…》
Dialogue: 0,0:20:09.52,0:20:11.14,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}上吧 希望皇霍普！
Dialogue: 0,0:20:12.66,0:20:14.69,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}攻击嘎嘎嘎蛮！
Dialogue: 0,0:20:15.53,0:20:18.53,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}休想！嘎嘎嘎侍的效果发动。
Dialogue: 0,0:20:18.92,0:20:20.73,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}嘎嘎嘎怪兽被攻击时{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:20:22.69,0:20:25.17,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}将攻击对象变更为这只怪兽
Dialogue: 0,0:20:25.17,0:20:26.95,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}并且变为守备表示。
Dialogue: 0,0:20:28.41,0:20:31.54,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}永续陷阱 阶级·革命 发动！
Dialogue: 0,0:20:32.65,0:20:33.55,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}自己场上
Dialogue: 0,0:20:33.55,0:20:35.75,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}只有1只超量怪兽的时候{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:20:36.47,0:20:38.85,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}持有那只怪兽以上阶级的
Dialogue: 0,0:20:38.85,0:20:40.96,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}怪兽的效果无效化。
Dialogue: 0,0:20:41.56,0:20:43.41,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}希望·根茎的阶级是1。
Dialogue: 0,0:20:44.47,0:20:47.41,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}因此 我我我侍的效果无效。
Dialogue: 0,0:20:50.03,0:20:53.57,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}希望剑根茎·斩！
Dialogue: 0,0:21:04.79,0:21:06.19,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}然后 就在这一瞬间
Dialogue: 0,0:21:06.19,0:21:09.32,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}永续陷阱 叠放·加速 发动！
Dialogue: 0,0:21:09.91,0:21:11.27,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}自己的超量怪兽
Dialogue: 0,0:21:11.27,0:21:13.19,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}在战斗中将怪兽破坏的时候{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:21:14.02,0:21:16.05,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}使用1个叠放单位
Dialogue: 0,0:21:16.05,0:21:18.25,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}让那只怪兽可以再攻击一次。
Dialogue: 0,0:21:18.66,0:21:19.85,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}什… 什么！？
Dialogue: 0,0:21:20.46,0:21:22.68,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}希望·根茎的叠放单位有3个。
Dialogue: 0,0:21:23.02,0:21:27.23,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这样下去 游马会受到连续攻击输掉的！
Dialogue: 0,0:21:27.47,0:21:30.30,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我要把希望之芽的超量单元
Dialogue: 0,0:21:30.30,0:21:31.07,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}用掉一个{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:21:31.66,0:21:33.40,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}再发动一次攻击！
Dialogue: 0,0:21:36.77,0:21:39.59,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}上吧 攻击嘎嘎嘎武士！
Dialogue: 0,0:21:49.48,0:21:52.62,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}夺回来吧 你所失去的
Dialogue: 0,0:21:52.62,0:21:54.71,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}最重要的东西！
Dialogue: 0,0:21:56.47,0:21:57.74,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}《我失去的…
Dialogue: 0,0:22:03.59,0:22:05.73,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}最重要的东西？》
Dialogue: 0,0:23:40.85,0:23:42.22,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:42.56,0:23:44.30,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:44.90,0:23:46.97,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:47.49,0:23:50.34,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:51.09,0:23:53.42,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:55.04,0:23:57.10,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:57.30,0:24:01.10,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:01.55,0:24:03.39,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:03.75,0:24:06.49,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:06.83,0:24:08.73,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}
